From 4884b5b85b4a9f5a4bffb7f1e95be52a0d24fae1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lakr233 <git@qaq.wiki>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:48:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 53/68] vgpu: preserve wide and integer render targets across
 Store, LOAD seed and sampled reads

Keep R16Float, RG16Float, RGBA16Float, RGBA16Unorm, RG16Uint, R32Float and RG32Float render targets in their declared texel format across engine resident allocation, verbatim CPU seed staging, native readback, synchronous and deferred Store writeback, heap-to-buffer blits, and buffer/surface sampled uploads instead of clamping through 8-bit RGBA8.
